This directory contains wgl vectors for running serial BIST on the ARM946E_8888
incorporation the ARM946E_88 core and test wrapper.

For running BIST on the cache memories use ARM946E_8888_Serial.wgl.gz .

For running BIST on the DTCM use one of the following, depending on size:
  ARM946E_8888_DTCM128KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_DTCM16KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_DTCM256KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_DTCM32KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_DTCM4KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_DTCM64KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_DTCM8KB_Serial.wgl.gz

For running BIST on the ITCM use one of the following, depending on size:
  ARM946E_8888_ITCM128KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_ITCM16KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_ITCM256KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_ITCM32KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_ITCM4KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_ITCM64KB_Serial.wgl.gz
  ARM946E_8888_ITCM8KB_Serial.wgl.gz
